      "content": "i don't think you understand. this isn't just a \"setback\". this is everything collapsing at once. my legal right to be here is gone. my family's money is gone. 5 years of my life are gone.\n\nand i keep thinking about it and like... there genuinely is no path forward that doesn't involve complete destruction. i've gone through every option. every single one ends with me being destroyed one way or another. some just take longer.\n\ni feel like such a burden. my parents would have been better off if they'd never sent me here",
